{"about_the_game":"Embark on a whimsical journey of physics-based puzzle-solving in the delightful world of GachaPon! Discover the art of relaxation as you immerse yourself in this charming game, where the goal is not just to solve puzzles, but to enjoy the process of being yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/extras/3d7482403fb3cf2c54c1885f91975792.poster.avif?t=1721074214\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/extras/3d7482403fb3cf2c54c1885f91975792.webm?t=1721074214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/extras/3d7482403fb3cf2c54c1885f91975792.mp4?t=1721074214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In GachaPon!, your mission is to drop colorful capsules into the case and fuse them together, all in pursuit of creating the legendary Rainbow Gacha. But there's more to this game than meets the eye! With a treasure trove of over thirty enchanting keychains, each one offering a unique twist to your gameplay, GachaPon! lets you customize your experience with endless possibilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/extras/56f43a2c721a5b3fb829d841549ff8f6.poster.avif?t=1721074214\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/extras/56f43a2c721a5b3fb829d841549ff8f6.webm?t=1721074214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/extras/56f43a2c721a5b3fb829d841549ff8f6.mp4?t=1721074214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Mix and match these quirky keychains to tailor each round to your liking, and watch as the dynamics of the game shift in delightful and unexpected ways. It's not just about winning; it's about the joy of experimentation and the satisfaction of finding your own path to success.<br><br>So, dive into the captivating world of GachaPon! Let the soothing physics-based puzzles wash over you, and revel in the freedom to play your way. Relax, unwind, and embrace the whimsy as you journey towards the coveted Rainbow Gacha and hit your next High Score \u2013 and don't forget, Practice Makes Perfect!<br>Join the chat","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2841960?t=1721074214","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2841960?t=1721074214","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1721074214","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1721074214","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2841970,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"Embark on a whimsical journey of physics-based puzzle-solving in the delightful world of GachaPon! Discover the art of relaxation as you immerse yourself in this charming game, where the goal is not just to solve puzzles, but to enjoy the process of being yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/extras/3d7482403fb3cf2c54c1885f91975792.poster.avif?t=1721074214\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/extras/3d7482403fb3cf2c54c1885f91975792.webm?t=1721074214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/extras/3d7482403fb3cf2c54c1885f91975792.mp4?t=1721074214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In GachaPon!, your mission is to drop colorful capsules into the case and fuse them together, all in pursuit of creating the legendary Rainbow Gacha. But there's more to this game than meets the eye! With a treasure trove of over thirty enchanting keychains, each one offering a unique twist to your gameplay, GachaPon! lets you customize your experience with endless possibilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/extras/56f43a2c721a5b3fb829d841549ff8f6.poster.avif?t=1721074214\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/extras/56f43a2c721a5b3fb829d841549ff8f6.webm?t=1721074214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/extras/56f43a2c721a5b3fb829d841549ff8f6.mp4?t=1721074214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Mix and match these quirky keychains to tailor each round to your liking, and watch as the dynamics of the game shift in delightful and unexpected ways. It's not just about winning; it's about the joy of experimentation and the satisfaction of finding your own path to success.<br><br>So, dive into the captivating world of GachaPon! Let the soothing physics-based puzzles wash over you, and revel in the freedom to play your way. Relax, unwind, and embrace the whimsy as you journey towards the coveted Rainbow Gacha and hit your next High Score \u2013 and don't forget, Practice Makes Perfect!<br>Join the chat","developers":["EXFMRENEL Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841960/head